      "comment": "HARA'S ODEN (1) was the fastest winner on the program last time out, running away to score by 7 lengths (25.06) at Shepparton. Ideally placed to score again. MORAINE KOBY (4) finished in the minors last time but the start prior broke the clock when winning over 500m at Bendigo, taking a Grade 5 in a powerful 27.97. Smart winner two back and looks a key chance on that form. BABY BEETS (2) was well in the market last time but only managed fifth (22.32), beaten 6 lengths. Finished second the start before. Boasts a strong record from this draw with four wins and two minor placings from nine starts. Worth another chance. MINER MICK (3) profiles nicely over this trip.",
